{
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - On 14th June 2024, the proposal as shown on the drawing submitted on 14th June 2024 and numbered PL001, PL002, PL003, PL004 was not lawful because:\r\n\r\nThe development fails to comply with the terms of Classes D and E of Part 1 of Schedule 2 of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) because the porch would exceed three metres in height and have a footprint exceeding three square metres, and the outbuilding would fail to relate incidentally to the main dwelling due to its inclusion of primary living facilities by way of a shower room.\r\n"
